    "q-106962": {
      "dom_id": "step-q106962",
      "name": "Question 4",
      "problem": "$$\n{{[\\begin{aligned}7 & -3 & -1 \\\\ 28 & -8 & -3 \\\\ -49 & 37 & 7\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{A}={{[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ 4 & 1 & 0 \\\\ -7 & 4 & 1\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{L}\\cdot {{[\\begin{aligned}7 & -3 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & \\boxed{}\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{U}.\n$$\n\nConsider the LU factorization of the matrix $A$ above. What is the value of ${u}_{33}$ in the matrix $U?$",
      "worked_solution": "The matrix $U$ in the LU decomposition is obtained from the original matrix $A$ by row-reducing using Gaussian elementation. In particular, to make zeros below the main diagonal, we proceed as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =[\\begin{aligned}7 & -3 & -1 \\\\ 28 & -8 & -3 \\\\ -49 & 37 & 7\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+(-4){R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}7 & -3 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 1 \\\\ -49 & 37 & 7\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+7{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}7 & -3 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 16 & 0\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+(-4){R}_{2} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}7 & -3 & -1 \\\\ 0 & 4 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -4\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, ${u}_{33}=-4.$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-106962-a",
