nselectable=\"on\" display=\"block\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><msub><mi>l</mi><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mn>21</mn></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mrow data-mjx-texclass=\"ORD\"><mstyle mathcolor=\"purple\"><mn>2</mn></mstyle></mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo>−</mo><mn>2.</mn></math></mjx-assistive-mml></mjx-container></p>\n</div></div>",
