    "q-105600": {
      "dom_id": "step-q105600",
      "name": "Question 10",
      "problem": "$$\n{{[\\begin{aligned}3 & -7 & 4 \\\\ -3 & 1 & 7 \\\\ -3 & 7 & -6\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{A}={{[\\begin{aligned}1 & 0 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ -1 & \\boxed{} & 1\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{L}\\cdot {{[\\begin{aligned}3 & -7 & 4 \\\\ 0 & -6 & 11 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -2\\end{aligned}]}_{⏟}}_{U}\n$$\n\nConsider the LU factorization of the matrix $A$ above. What is the value of the entry ${l}_{32}$ in the matrix $L?$",
      "worked_solution": "The matrix $U$ in the LU decomposition is obtained from the original matrix $A$ by row-reducing using Gaussian elementation. In particular, to make zeros below the main diagonal, we proceed as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}A & =[\\begin{aligned}3 & -7 & 4 \\\\ -3 & 1 & 7 \\\\ -3 & 7 & -6\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{2} & :={R}_{2}+1{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}3 & -7 & 4 \\\\ 0 & -6 & 11 \\\\ -3 & 7 & -6\\end{aligned}] & {R}_{3} & :={R}_{3}+1{R}_{1} \\\\  & ∼[\\begin{aligned}3 & -7 & 4 \\\\ 0 & -6 & 11 \\\\ 0 & 0 & -2\\end{aligned}]\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNotice that the position ${a}_{32}$ is already $0.$ Therefore, the entry ${l}_{32}$ of the matrix $L$ is\n\n$$\n{l}_{32}=0.\n$$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "selection",
          "type": "radio",
          "choices": [
            {
              "option": "a",
              "dom_id": "questionWidget-choiceLetterCircle-105600-a",
